Z||000000||trigger||03-11-2001||03:38 PM||||on march 10, of 2000 i bought my 1988 fiero coupe.  It's my first car.  I bought it with 113,820 miles on it.  Now it has around 119 k.<P>i'll try some pics.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieroin1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieroou0.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieroou1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieroou2.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieroout.jpg"> <P>I took those pics not to long after I bought the car last march. I have since added power<BR>trunk release, an optimus detachable face cassete deck, an 8 inch optimus pro series sub in footwell box, a 150 watt 2 channel pyramid amp, a pair of infinity reference 4x6's in the front and optimus 4x6's in the back. I need to get a better crossover, and i need to try a different box to see if I can get it to hit harder. Oh, and the car has since acquired pinstripes on the right front and rear fenders. I'd still like to catch that kid. Oh, well. Any opinions. <P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trigger.gif"> ||||reg||10
