Z||000004||Black88GT||03-11-2001||04:47 PM||||Damn trigger, is that the original paint? If so, it held well over the years, looks great.<P>Oh yeah, for your wheels, look for a pair of 88 Formula/GT wheels.  You'll like how it handles even more.  You can probably find a nice set for cheaper then it would cost to do your wheels.  Just a suggestion.  For the sub box, check out stimpy's post on fiberglass footwell enclosures.  You could make a sweet enclosure for the footwell for that 8" sub.  The cool thing about an 8" is that you can make the box so its flush where the foot pad is, will look/sound sweet.<BR> <P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fieropage/af.bmp"> ||||reg||14
